<translate>
==== CustomEatSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the sound that will play when the item is eaten.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
CustomEatSound = EatingFruit,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

